(13,59,'admin','update','blocks',37,'{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Block 37\",\"ai_summary\":\"Welcome to this block! Living here offers a mix of positives and challenges, creating a unique daily experience. Residents love the beautifully designed and spacious units, along with the accommodating staff and excellent amenities that enhance their quality of life.\\n\\nHowever, the presence of nearby construction has been a significant source of frustration, impacting the overall tranquility of the area. This has led to some residents feeling disappointed that the initial appeal seen in photos did not align with their lived experience, resulting in a reluctance to consider staying long-term.\\n\\nLooking at sentiment trends, there have been fluctuations over time. There were positive sentiments at the start, but as construction intensified, negative feelings crept in. While there have been moments of positivity, the ongoing disruptions have maintained a level of dissatisfaction among residents, reflected in the forecasted average rating of 1.7.\\n\\nIf you\'re considering moving here, it\'s important to weigh the pros and cons. The allure of the units and amenities is undeniable, but the potential noise and disturbances from\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood offers a mix of positives and challenges, providing residents with a unique daily experience. While the beautifully designed units and excellent amenities are appealing, nearby construction has been a significant source of frustration, impacting the overall tranquility of the area. This has resulted in some residents feeling disappointed and reluctant to consider staying long-term.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"Residents have shown a mix of positive and negative sentiments, with initial positivity giving way to dissatisfaction due to ongoing disruptions from nearby construction.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-04\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-08\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0}\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s livability forecast indicates a challenging environment for residents due to the ongoing disruptions caused by nearby construction. While the beautifully designed units and excellent amenities enhance the quality of life, the disturbances have led to a decrease in overall satisfaction among residents. The sentiment analysis reveals a shift from initial positivity to increased negativity over time, with the forecasted average rating standing at 1.7.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Consider the potential noise and disturbances from nearby construction before making a decision to move into the neighborhood.\\\",\\n        \\\"Evaluate the trade-offs between the appealing units and amenities and the impact of ongoing disruptions on your daily life.\\\",\\n        \\\"Engage with current residents to gain insights into their experiences and perceptions of the neighborhood before committing to a long-term stay.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":1.7,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-11-25 04:45:26\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-04\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-08\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-24T20:45:26.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}','{\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-26 06:42:26\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}','127.0.0.1','2025-11-25 22:42:26','2025-11-25 22:42:26'),
