(30,59,'admin','update','blocks',37,'{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Block 37\",\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this particular block offers a mixed bag of experiences, like flipping through a storybook with both bright and dark chapters. Residents rave about the property\'s beauty and tranquility, boasting spacious units and top-notch amenities that make daily life feel like a dream. The staff\'s friendliness and attentiveness add a warm touch, creating a welcoming atmosphere for those who call this place home.\\n\\nHowever, this idyllic setting is somewhat overshadowed by the disruptive presence of nearby construction, casting a shadow over the overall charm of the neighborhood. Some residents were disappointed that the reality didn\'t quite match the picture-perfect images they saw, expressing a longing for improvements to truly elevate their living experience.\\n\\nLooking at the sentiment trends, it seems like the initial positive vibes have gradually been diluted by the challenges residents face, leading to a decline in overall satisfaction. While there have been moments of positivity sprinkled throughout, the negative sentiments seem to be gaining momentum, indicating a growing sense of discontent among the community.\\n\\nFor\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n\\t\\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood offers a blend of positive and negative aspects, with residents praising the property\'s beauty and tranquility while being impacted by nearby construction. The staff\'s friendliness and amenities contribute to a welcoming atmosphere, though some residents express disappointment and a desire for improvements to enhance their living experience.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment in the neighborhood is mixed, with initial positive feelings gradually giving way to increased challenges and a decline in overall satisfaction. While there are sporadic moments of positivity, negative sentiments appear to be on the rise, indicating a growing sense of discontent among residents.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-11\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 0\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 1\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-04\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 1\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 1\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-08\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 1\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 0\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t],\\n\\t\\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"Despite the property\'s positive attributes, the neighborhood faces challenges due to nearby construction impacting residents\' satisfaction levels. The fluctuating sentiment trends suggest a need for addressing the concerns raised by residents to prevent further decline in overall livability. The growing negative sentiments could potentially lead to a decrease in the desirability of the neighborhood if not effectively managed. It is crucial for stakeholders to take proactive steps in resolving issues and enhancing the neighborhood\'s appeal to maintain a favorable rating.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n\\t\\t\\\"Conduct a thorough review of the construction impact on residents and implement measures to minimize disruptions.\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"Engage with residents to gather feedback and address their concerns to improve overall satisfaction levels.\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"Invest in enhancements and upgrades to the property to meet residents\' expectations and elevate the living experience.\\\"\\n\\t]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.6,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-11-26 06:42:53\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-04\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-08\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-25T22:42:53.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}','{\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-29 14:01:26\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}','127.0.0.1','2025-11-29 06:01:26','2025-11-29 06:01:26'),
