 {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s livability forecast is influenced by the mixed sentiments expressed by residents. While some see potential for growth and investment, others face challenges that detract from the overall appeal. This dynamic interplay between positive and negative experiences creates a fluctuating environment that can impact property trends. Potential buyers or investors should carefully consider the varying sentiments and seek to understand the underlying factors driving these opinions to make informed decisions about real estate in the area. Monitoring sentiment trends and community developments will be crucial for predicting future property dynamics.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engage with current residents to gain firsthand insights into the neighborhood\'s strengths and weaknesses.\\\",\\n        \\\"Conduct a thorough analysis of property maintenance and management practices to assess the potential impact on future property values.\\\",\\n        \\\"Stay informed about local community initiatives and development plans to gauge the area\'s growth potential.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",