(84,59,'admin','update','blocks',1,'{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Block 1\",\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a mixed bag of experiences, akin to a rollercoaster ride with ups and downs. Some residents have raved about the block, highlighting its potential for a great return on investment, hinting at a promising future. On the flip side, there are grumblings about maintenance issues, leaking ceilings, lackluster service, and unresponsive staff, painting a less-than-ideal picture of daily life.\\n\\nRecent sentiment data reveals a fluctuating pattern. Positive sentiments have been sporadic, with occasional bursts of contentment, but negative feelings seem to linger a bit longer. This seesaw of emotions might reflect the unpredictable nature of living here, where moments of satisfaction are punctuated by frustrations.\\n\\nIf you\'re considering moving to this block, it\'s essential to weigh the pros and cons carefully. The investment potential could be a significant draw for those looking to make a smart financial move. However, be prepared for potential maintenance challenges and subpar service experiences, which could test your\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood forecast for living on this block presents a mixture of positive and negative aspects, creating a diverse experience for residents. While some individuals praise the block for its potential for a high return on investment and a bright future, others express dissatisfaction due to maintenance issues, leaky ceilings, poor service quality, and unresponsive staff members, painting a less favorable picture of daily life. The forecast indicates a fluctuating pattern of sentiment, with sporadic positive emotions overshadowed by lingering negative feelings, reflecting the unpredictable nature of residing in this area.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment analysis reveals a blend of positive and negative feedback, with the overall sentiment leaning slightly towards the negative end due to persistent concerns and frustrations expressed by residents.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s forecasted rating of 2.54 suggests a moderately average living experience, indicating a mix of positive and negative factors that residents may encounter. While the block offers potential for a good return on investment, residents should be prepared for maintenance challenges and service quality issues that may impact their daily lives. The fluctuating sentiment data indicates an uncertain environment with moments of contentment being dampened by ongoing frustrations. Prospective residents should carefully evaluate the trade-offs between financial gains and potential living difficulties before making a decision to move to this block.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should conduct thorough research on the property\'s maintenance history and the responsiveness of the management staff to address issues promptly.\\\",\\n        \\\"Investors looking at properties in this neighborhood should consider the long-term potential for growth and weigh it against the current challenges faced by residents.\\\",\\n        \\\"Residents already living on this block should actively engage with the community to address common concerns collaboratively and work towards improving overall living conditions.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.54,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 15:25:13\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T07:25:13.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}','{\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 15:47:25\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}','127.0.0.1','2025-12-03 07:47:25','2025-12-03 07:47:25'),
