 of optimism and contentment, there are also prevalent feelings of dissatisfaction and challenges that impact the overall livability of the neighborhood.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s forecasted rating of 3.44 reflects the complex nature of the block, where the interplay of positives and negatives creates a nuanced living environment. Residents may continue to experience fluctuations in sentiment and living conditions as the community navigates through its growth and improvement phases. It is crucial for stakeholders to address maintenance issues and enhance communication channels to foster a more cohesive and positive neighborhood experience.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Implement regular maintenance checks and address issues promptly to improve overall living conditions.\\\",\\n        \\\"Enhance communication and engagement between residents and management to build a stronger sense of community and address grievances effectively.\\\",\\n        \\\"Invest in community initiatives and projects that promote a sense of belonging and improve the neighborhood\'s overall appeal.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":3.44,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 19:46:56\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\