 specific circumstances they encounter.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"Considering the mix of positive and negative sentiments expressed by residents, the forecasted rating for this block stands at 3.44. This rating reflects the varying experiences and perceptions shared by individuals residing in the neighborhood. It is crucial for potential residents to carefully evaluate the pros and cons of living on this block to make an informed decision about their future accommodation.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should conduct thorough research on the block\'s condition and management responsiveness before making a decision.\\\",\\n        \\\"It is advisable to engage with current residents to gain insights into their living experiences and assess the compatibility of the neighborhood with personal preferences.\\\",\\n        \\\"Maintaining a flexible and patient attitude towards potential challenges is essential for individuals considering a move to this block.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":3.44,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 20:31:39\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negativ