(135,59,'admin','update','blocks',1,'{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Block 1\",\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a mixed bag of experiences, as shared by current residents. Some highlight challenges such as poor maintenance, leaking ceilings, and slow responses from management, painting a somewhat frustrating picture. These issues can undoubtedly impact daily life and create discomfort for residents who expect a certain level of care and attention.\\n\\nHowever, amidst these concerns, there is a glimmer of hope. One resident stands out, expressing a fantastic experience and praising the block for its great investment potential. This positive outlook suggests that despite the current drawbacks, there may be promising opportunities for those who see the bigger picture and are willing to invest in the area for the long term.\\n\\nLooking at sentiment trends, the data shows fluctuations over time. While there are moments of positivity, they seem to be balanced out by periods of negativity. This seesaw effect could indicate that residents\' experiences on this block vary, with some moments of satisfaction and others of discontent.\\n\\nFor someone considering a move to this block, it\'s essential to weigh the\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n\\t\\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood presents a mix of experiences for residents, with varying levels of satisfaction and issues. While some residents report challenges like poor maintenance and slow management responses, there are positive aspects such as great investment potential highlighted by others. This creates a nuanced picture of livability that requires careful consideration before making a decision.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment in the neighborhood is diverse, reflecting both positive and negative experiences among residents. While some express contentment and optimism about the area, others face frustrations due to maintenance issues and management responsiveness.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n\\t\\t{\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n\\t\\t{\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n\\t\\t{\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n\\t\\t{\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n\\t\\t{\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n\\t\\t{\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0}\\n\\t],\\n\\t\\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"Despite the mixed sentiment among residents, the neighborhood\'s forecasted rating stands at 3.44. This rating indicates a moderate level of livability, taking into account both positive and negative aspects of the area. The fluctuating sentiment trends suggest that while there are opportunities for improvement, there are also challenges that need to be addressed to enhance overall satisfaction for residents. Potential investors should carefully evaluate the neighborhood\'s current state and future prospects before making any decisions.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n\\t\\t\\\"Potential residents should conduct thorough research and visit the neighborhood to assess its suitability based on personal preferences and needs.\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"Property investors should consider the mixed sentiment as an opportunity to potentially capitalize on undervalued properties or areas with growth potential.\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"Local authorities and property management should address maintenance issues and improve responsiveness to enhance overall livability and resident satisfaction.\\\"\\n\\t]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":3.44,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 21:29:54\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T13:29:54.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}','{\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-04 02:24:23\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}','127.0.0.1','2025-12-03 18:24:23','2025-12-03 18:24:23'),
