(185,59,'admin','update','blocks',1,'{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Block 1\",\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a mixed bag of experiences, as shared by residents. On one hand, there is excitement about the area\'s potential for investment and the charm it holds for some. However, challenges like poor maintenance, leaking ceilings, and unresponsive management have also been voiced by others.\\n\\nThe forecasted average rating of 3.44 indicates a somewhat average satisfaction level among residents. Looking at the sentiment trends, it\'s clear that opinions have fluctuated over time. Positive sentiments in December 2024 and May 2025 were balanced by negative ones in March 2025 and June 2025, showing the dynamic nature of residents\' experiences.\\n\\nDaily life on this block may offer glimpses of promise, with potential for growth and investment opportunities that some find appealing. However, it\'s essential to be prepared for maintenance issues and service challenges that might test your patience.\\n\\nIf you\'re considering moving here, it\'s wise to conduct thorough research and perhaps speak to current residents to get a better\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood offers a mix of experiences, with residents expressing both excitement for investment potential and charm, alongside concerns about poor maintenance, leaking ceilings, and unresponsive management. The average rating of 3.44 signifies a moderate satisfaction level among residents. Sentiment analysis shows fluctuating opinions, with positive sentiments in December 2024 and May 2025 balancing out negative ones in March 2025 and June 2025.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"Residents have varied views on the neighborhood, with some appreciating its potential for growth and investment while others highlight maintenance and management issues. The sentiment trends indicate a dynamic and evolving community experience.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood presents a blend of potential and challenges, reflecting the diverse experiences of its residents. While there are opportunities for growth and investment that appeal to some, issues such as maintenance problems and unresponsive management can impact the overall livability of the area. The fluctuating sentiment trends suggest an evolving environment where residents\' perceptions can vary over time. It is essential for prospective residents to conduct thorough research and engage with current inhabitants to gain a comprehensive understanding of the neighborhood dynamics.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should engage with current residents to gather insights on the neighborhood\'s livability and potential challenges.\\\",\\n        \\\"Consider the fluctuating sentiment trends as an indication of the dynamic nature of community experiences in the area.\\\",\\n        \\\"Prioritize thorough research on maintenance standards and management responsiveness before committing to a move to this neighborhood.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":3.44,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-04 15:16:57\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-04T07:16:57.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}','{\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-05 11:16:51\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}','127.0.0.1','2025-12-05 03:16:51','2025-12-05 03:16:51'),
