(187,59,'admin','update','blocks',1,'{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Block 1\",\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a mix of experiences, with residents sharing varied opinions that paint a nuanced picture of daily life. Some neighbors express frustration with issues like poor maintenance, leaking ceilings, and unresponsive staff, which can understandably impact their overall satisfaction. Slow management responses have also been a common concern, adding to the challenges faced by residents.\\n\\nDespite these drawbacks, there are bright spots that shine through in the feedback. Some residents highlight a fantastic experience living here, pointing out the great investment potential the area holds. One individual even mentions a desire to return, indicating that there are aspects of the community that hold appeal and potential for a positive living experience.\\n\\nLooking at sentiment trends over time, we see fluctuations in resident opinions. While there have been periods with more negative feedback, there are also instances of positive sentiment shining through. This ebb and flow suggests that the neighborhood\'s livability can vary, potentially influenced by factors such as management responsiveness, maintenance quality, and community dynamics.\\n\\nFor those considering a move\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood presents a mix of experiences for residents, with varying opinions providing a nuanced view of daily life. Challenges such as poor maintenance, unresponsive staff, and slow management responses have impacted overall satisfaction levels. However, positive aspects like investment potential and appealing community features offer bright spots amidst the drawbacks.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment analysis reveals a diverse range of opinions among residents, reflecting the complex nature of living in this neighborhood.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s livability forecast indicates a rating of 2.54, reflecting the mixed sentiments and experiences reported by residents. The fluctuating sentiment trends over time suggest that the community\'s appeal and satisfaction levels can vary, influenced by factors such as management responsiveness, maintenance quality, and overall community dynamics. Prospective residents should consider the diverse feedback and be prepared for both positive and negative aspects of living in this neighborhood.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should conduct thorough research and visit the neighborhood multiple times to get a comprehensive understanding of its livability.\\\",\\n        \\\"Engage with current residents to gain insights into their experiences and perspectives on daily life in the community.\\\",\\n        \\\"Evaluate personal priorities and preferences to determine if the neighborhood\'s mix of positive and negative aspects align with individual expectations.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.54,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-05 11:20:50\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-05T03:20:50.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}','{\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-05 11:25:19\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}','127.0.0.1','2025-12-05 03:25:19','2025-12-05 03:25:19'),
