INSERT INTO `blocks` VALUES
(1,'Block 1','Living on this block offers a mix of experiences, ranging from challenges to potential gems waiting to be discovered. Residents have voiced concerns about noise disturbances from pets, maintenance issues like leaking ceilings, and dissatisfaction with services and staff friendliness. Slow responses from management have also been a common frustration among residents. These factors contribute to a forecasted average rating of 2.84, indicating a below-average satisfaction level.\n\nDespite these challenges, there is a glimmer of hope shining through the feedback. One resident expressed a fantastic experience and even highlighted the area\'s great investment potential. This positive sentiment hints at the block\'s hidden opportunities for those willing to look beyond its current drawbacks.\n\nAnalyzing the sentiment trends over time, we see fluctuations in residents\' feelings. While some months showed a balance of positive and negative sentiments, others leaned more towards the negative side. The lack of consistent positive feedback suggests that the block\'s issues may outweigh its strengths, at least in the eyes of most residents.\n\nIf you\'re considering moving','{\n    \"executive_summary\": \"The neighborhood forecast for this block reflects a mix of challenges and potential opportunities. Residents have expressed concerns about noise disturbances, maintenance issues, and dissatisfaction with services and staff friendliness, leading to an anticipated average rating of 2.84, below the satisfaction benchmark. However, amidst these challenges, there are positive sentiments indicating hidden opportunities for investment and a fantastic living experience, showcasing a glimmer of hope amidst the criticisms.\",\n    \"sentiment_analysis\": \"The sentiment analysis reveals a blend of positive and negative feedback from residents, with fluctuations observed over time. While there are moments of positivity and praise for the area\'s investment potential, negative sentiments, such as noise disturbances and slow management responses, persist, suggesting a mixed perception among residents.\",\n    \"monthly_sentiment\": [\n        { \"month\": \"2024-12\", \"positive\": 1, \"negative\": 0 },\n        { \"month\": \"2025-03\", \"positive\": 0, \"negative\": 1 },\n        { \"month\": \"2025-05\", \"positive\": 1, \"negative\": 1 },\n        { \"month\": \"2025-06\", \"positive\": 0, \"negative\": 1 },\n        { \"month\": \"2025-11\", \"positive\": 0, \"negative\": 0 },\n        { \"month\": \"2025-12\", \"positive\": 0, \"negative\": 0 }\n    ],\n    \"forecast_details\": \"The neighborhood\'s forecasted rating of 2.84 indicates below-average satisfaction levels primarily due to ongoing issues like noise disturbances and slow management responses. Despite occasional positive sentiments highlighting investment potential and great experiences, the overall sentiment remains mixed, with negative feedback outweighing the positives. The fluctuating sentiment trends suggest that the block\'s challenges may overshadow its strengths in the eyes of most residents, emphasizing the need for improvements in service quality and addressing maintenance concerns to enhance overall livability.\",\n    \"recommendations\": [\n        \"Implement measures to address noise disturbances and improve maintenance response times to enhance resident satisfaction.\",\n        \"Enhance staff training to promote better customer service and friendliness, addressing concerns raised by residents.\",\n        \"Engage with residents to gather feedback regularly and prioritize areas for improvement based on their suggestions and experiences.\"\n    ]\n}',2.84,'2025-12-05 03:25:46','{\"2024-12\":{\"positive\":1,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":0},\"2025-03\":{\"positive\":0,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":1},\"2025-05\":{\"positive\":1,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":1},\"2025-06\":{\"positive\":0,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":1},\"2025-11\":{\"positive\":0,\"neutral\":1,\"negative\":0},\"2025-12\":{\"positive\":0,\"neutral\":1,\"negative\":0}}','2025-10-20 22:15:58','2025-12-05 03:25:46','basic/housemodel.glb','done'),
(2,'Block 2','Living on this block offers a mixed bag of experiences, much like a rollercoaster ride with its ups and downs. Imagine waking up to the peaceful environment and lush greenery that residents often rave about, feeling like you\'ve stumbled upon a hidden gem perfect for families. It\'s the kind of place where you can envision creating lasting memories and enjoying the simple joys of everyday life.\n\nHowever, not everything is smooth sailing. Some residents have voiced concerns about the service quality, citing instances of staff ignoring requests and slow responses from management. Noise levels can also be an issue, disrupting the otherwise serene atmosphere that makes this block so appealing.\n\nLooking at sentiment trends, there seems to be a fluctuation in residents\' feelings over time. Positive sentiments have been on the rise, indicating an improvement in some aspects that residents appreciate. On the other hand, negative sentiments have also made their presence felt, highlighting ongoing challenges that need to be addressed for a more harmonious community living experience.\n\nIf you\'re considering moving to','{\n    \"executive_summary\": \"Living in this neighborhood offers a diverse range of experiences, akin to a rollercoaster journey with its high points and challenges. Residents wake up to a tranquil setting with abundant greenery, often describing it as a hidden gem ideal for families, fostering a sense of creating cherished memories and embracing the simple pleasures of daily life. However, there are concerns regarding service quality, including reports of staff overlooking requests and management slow to respond. Noise disturbances occasionally disrupt the peaceful ambiance that characterizes this neighborhood\'s allure.\",\n    \"sentiment_analysis\": \"Residents exhibit a mix of positive and negative sentiments towards the neighborhood, reflecting varying experiences and perspectives. While positive sentiments have shown an upward trend, signaling improvements in certain areas appreciated by residents, negative sentiments also persist, highlighting ongoing issues that require attention for enhanced community living.\",\n    \"monthly_sentiment\": [\n        {\"month\": \"2024-12\", \"positive\": 0, \"negative\": 1},\n        {\"month\": \"2025-02\", \"positive\": 1, \"negative\": 0},\n        {\"month\": \"2025-06\", \"positive\": 1, \"negative\": 1},\n        {\"month\": \"2025-08\", \"positive\": 1, \"negative\": 0},\n        {\"month\": \"2025-10\", \"positive\": 1, \"negative\": 1},\n        {\"month\": \"2025-11\", \"positive\": 0, \"negative\": 0}\n    ],\n    \"forecast_details\": \"The neighborhood\'s livability forecast presents a rating of 2.59, indicating a moderate level of satisfaction among residents. With a blend of positive and negative sentiments, the community\'s experiences vary, potentially influencing future trends in property desirability and value. As ongoing challenges are addressed and improvements implemented, the neighborhood may witness shifts in sentiment and overall appeal, impacting real estate dynamics and resident satisfaction.\",\n    \"recommendations\": [\n        \"Enhance communication channels between residents, staff, and management to address service quality concerns and promote a more responsive environment.\",\n        \"Implement noise mitigation strategies to maintain the peaceful ambiance and alleviate disruptions experienced by residents, fostering a harmonious living atmosphere.\",\n        \"Continuously monitor sentiment trends and gather feedback from residents to identify areas for improvement and prioritize community enhancements for a more enjoyable living experience.\"\n    ]\n}',2.59,'2025-11-10 13:04:25','{\"2024-12\":{\"positive\":0,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":1},\"2025-02\":{\"positive\":1,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":0},\"2025-06\":{\"positive\":1,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":1},\"2025-08\":{\"positive\":1,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":0},\"2025-10\":{\"positive\":1,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":1},\"2025-11\":{\"positive\":0,\"neutral\":1,\"negative\":0}}','2025-10-20 22:15:58','2025-11-10 13:04:25','basic/housemodel.glb','done'),
