f both praise for the community spirit and discontent regarding customer support and pricing. Monthly sentiment data shows that in April 2025, there was 1 positive sentiment and 0 negative sentiments. In June 2025, sentiment shifted to 0 positive and 1 negative. September 2025 also recorded 0 positive and 1 negative sentiment, while October 2025 saw a return to 1 positive sentiment and 0 negative sentiments.\n\n**3. Forecast Details:**\nThe forecasted rating for the neighborhood is 2.39, reflecting the mixed nature of resident experiences. The community\'s strengths lie in its close-knit environment and access to quality amenities, fostering a sense of belonging among residents. However, challenges related to customer support and perceived property costs have influenced sentiment negatively. The forecasted rating serves as an indicator of the overall livability of the neighborhood, encompassing both positive and negative factors.\n\n**4. Recommendations:**\nBased on the sentiment trends and forecasted rating, it is recommended that efforts be made to address concerns related to customer support and pricing. Improving the quality of assistance provided to residents and ensuring transparency in property costs can help enhance overall satisfaction levels. Additionally, leveraging the existing strong community spirit to address these challenges collaboratively can contribute to a more balanced and positive neighborhood experience. Regular monitoring of sentiment trends and proactive measures to address feedback can further support the improvement of neighborhood livability.',2.39,'2025-10-27 22:03:50','{\"2025-04\":{\"positive\":1,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":0},\"2025-06\":{\"positive\":0,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":1},\"2025-09\":{\"positive\":0,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":1},\"2025-10\":{\"positive\":1,\"neutral\":0,\"negative\":0}}','2025-10-20 22:15:58','2025-10-27 22:03:50','basic/housemodel.glb','idle'),
