_report\":\"{\\n\\t\\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood offers a blend of positive and negative aspects, with residents praising the property\'s beauty and tranquility while being impacted by nearby construction. The staff\'s friendliness and amenities contribute to a welcoming atmosphere, though some residents express disappointment and a desire for improvements to enhance their living experience.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment in the neighborhood is mixed, with initial positive feelings gradually giving way to increased challenges and a decline in overall satisfaction. While there are sporadic moments of positivity, negative sentiments appear to be on the rise, indicating a growing sense of discontent among residents.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-11\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 0\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 1\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-04\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 1\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 1\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-08\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 1\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\\"negative\\\": 0\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t],\\n\\t\\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"Despite the property\'s positive attributes, the neighborhood faces challenges due to nearby construction impacting residents\' satisfaction levels. The fluctuating sentiment trends suggest a need for addressing the concerns raised by residents to prevent further decline in overall livability. The growing negative sentiments could potentially lead to a decrease in the desirability of the neighborhood if not effectively managed. It is crucial for stakeholders to take proactive steps in resolving issues and enhancing the neighborhood\'s appeal to maintain a favorable rating.\\\",\\n\\t\\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n\\t\\t\\\"Conduct a thorough review of the construction impact on residents and implement measures to minimize disruptions.\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"Engage with residents to gather feedback and address their concerns to improve overall satisfaction levels.\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\\"Invest in enhancements and upgrades to the property to meet residents\' expectations and elevate the living experience.\\\"\\n\\t]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.6,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-11-26 06:42:53\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-04\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-08\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-29T06:01:26.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, {\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a mixed bag of experiences. Residents appreciate the beautiful design and spacious units, along with the peaceful environment and great amenities that enhance daily life. However, the presence of nearby construction has cast a shadow over the overall experience, causing frustration and inconvenience for those in the community.\\n\\nThe sentiment trends over time show a fluctuating pattern, with periods of positivity followed by bouts of negativity. While there have been moments of contentment and satisfaction, they have been offset by challenges and disappointments, leading to an average rating of 1.7 out of 5.\\n\\nIf you\'re considering moving to this block, it\'s important to weigh the pros and cons carefully. Take note of the beautiful surroundings and well-appointed living spaces, but also be prepared for potential disruptions due to ongoing construction activities. Keep in mind that the reality may not always match the expectations set by photos, and there may be room for improvements to enhance the overall living experience.\\n\\nBefore making a decision, consider reaching out to\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"Living on this block offers a mix of positive and negative experiences. Residents appreciate the beautiful design, spacious units, peaceful environment, and great amenities that enhance daily life. However, the presence of nearby construction has caused frustration and inconvenience for the community.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment trends over time show a fluctuating pattern, with periods of positivity followed by bouts of negativity. Moments of contentment and satisfaction have been offset by challenges and disappointments, leading to an average rating of 1.7 out of 5.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-11\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-04\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-08\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood forecast indicates a mixed sentiment among residents, with varying levels of satisfaction and discontentment. The beautiful design, spacious units, and great amenities contribute positively to the livability of the area. However, the ongoing construction activities have been a source of frustration and inconvenience, impacting the overall experience. The fluctuating sentiment trends suggest that while there are moments of happiness and contentment, they are counterbalanced by periods of challenges and disappointments. The average rating of 1.7 reflects the polarized nature of residents\' experiences on this block.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Potential residents should carefully weigh the benefits of the beautiful surroundings, spacious living spaces, and amenities against the disruptions caused by nearby construction.\\\",\\n        \\\"It is advisable to manage expectations and be prepared for potential inconveniences or disturbances resulting from the construction activities in the area.\\\",\\n        \\\"Prospective residents may benefit from visiting the neighborhood at different times to assess the noise levels and disruptions caused by construction before making a decision.\\\",\\n        \\\"Engaging with current residents or community forums can provide valuable insights into the day-to-day challenges and advantages of living in the neighborhood.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":1.7,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-11-29T06:01:55.931482Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-29 14:01:55\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}, 127.0.0.1, 2025-11-29 14:01:55, 2025-11-29 14:01:55)) in /home/glitched/lot-match-new/vendor/laravel/framework/src/Illuminate/Database/Connection.php:825\nStack trace:\n#0 /home/glitched/lot-match-new/vendor/laravel/framework/src/Illuminate/Database/Connection.php(779): Illuminate\\Database\\Connection->runQueryCallback()\n#1 /