xed experience for residents, with differing opinions on service quality and investment potential. While some praise the attentive service and see it as a promising investment opportunity, others express frustration over maintenance issues and unresponsive management. The overall sentiment suggests that the living experience on this block can vary significantly depending on individual circumstances.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment analysis reveals a diverse range of opinions among residents regarding their living experience on this block. Positive feedback highlights attentive service and investment potential, while negative feedback points out maintenance issues and management responsiveness as areas of concern.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-02\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood forecast indicates a rating of 2.54 for living on this block. This rating suggests a moderate level of satisfaction based on the mixed sentiments expressed by residents. The fluctuations in positive and negative feedback over time indicate that the living experience can be inconsistent, with both favorable and challenging aspects. Prospective residents should carefully evaluate the feedback and consider reaching out to current residents for a more comprehensive understanding of the day-to-day living conditions and management responsiveness.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should conduct thorough research and gather insights from current residents to assess the suitability of living on this block.\\\",\\n        \\\"Consider the mixed sentiment trends and weigh the pros and cons carefully before making a decision to move to this neighborhood.\\\",\\n        \\\"Evaluate the investment potential and service quality against the reported maintenance issues and management responsiveness to make an informed choice.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.54,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-11-25 04:07:40\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-02\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":2,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T04:53:56.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, {\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a blend of experiences, with residents expressing a mix of satisfaction and frustration. Some highlight concerns such as poor maintenance, leaking ceilings, unfriendly staff, and slow responses from management. On the flip side, others are enthused about the area\'s potential for a sound investment.\\n\\nDaily life on this block may be a bit of a gamble. If you\'re lucky, you might find yourself amidst a thriving community brimming with investment opportunities. However, the looming issues like maintenance and management could cast a shadow over your experience.\\n\\nAnalyzing sentiment trends, it seems that opinions fluctuate over time. While there are moments of positivity, they are often balanced out by negative experiences. This seesaw of sentiments could indica