mary\\\": \\\"Living on this block presents a mixed experience for residents, with varying perspectives and challenges. While some see investment potential, others encounter issues like poor maintenance and unresponsive management. The block evokes a range of emotions among its inhabitants, indicating a diverse living environment.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment analysis reveals fluctuating opinions on the neighborhood block, with a mix of positive and negative feedback. While some months show balanced sentiments, others lean towards negativity, suggesting an unpredictable living experience.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0}\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The forecasted average rating of 2.54 indicates a moderate level of satisfaction among residents. The fluctuating sentiment trends suggest that satisfaction levels vary over time, with some months showing a balance of positive and negative feedback while others leaning towards negativity. This inconsistency may point to an element of unpredictability in the living experience on this block.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should carefully weigh the advantages and disadvantages of living on this block before making a decision.\\\",\\n        \\\"Thorough research on the management practices and maintenance history of the building is advisable for those considering a move to this area.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.54,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 14:42:55\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T06:48:53.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, {\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block is a bit of a mixed bag, like a rollercoaster ride with its ups and downs. Some residents have faced challenges, from dealing with terrible maintenance and leaking ceilings to encountering unfriendly staff and slow management responses. It\'s not all smooth sailing.\\n\\nOn the flip side, there are residents who have had a fantastic experience here and even see great investment potential in the area. They appreciate certain aspects of the community that make them consider coming back despite the challenges.\\n\\nLooking at the sentiment trends over time, it seems like there have been fluctuations in residents\' experiences. There have been periods with positive feedback, followed by negative ones, indicating a somewhat inconsistent living environment. It\'s essential to consider these ups and downs when thinking about moving to this block.\\n\\nIf you\'re considering making this block your new home, it\'s crucial to weigh the pros and cons carefully. While there are residents who find value and potential here, the challenges highlighted by others should not be overlooked. Make sure to\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"```json\\n{\\n  \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"Living on this block presents a mixed experience, akin to a rollercoaster ride with its ups and downs. While some residents have encountered challenges such as poor maintenance, leaking ceilings, unfriendly staff, and slow management responses, others have found the neighborhood to offer investment potential and positive living experiences. The sentiment among residents varies, indicating an inconsistent living environment that requires careful consideration when contemplating a move to this block.\\\",\\n  \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"Residents\' experiences on this block range from challenges to opportunities, reflecting a diverse and somewhat unpredictable living environment.\\\",\\n  \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n    { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n    { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n    { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n    { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n    { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n    { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The block\'s forecasted rating of 2.54 suggests a moderately average living experience, influenced by the varying sentiments and experiences of residents. The block\'s livability is likely to continue fluctuating, reflecting the mixed feedback and challenges faced by current residents. Potential homebuyers should carefully evaluate the pros and cons of living in this neighborhood, considering both the positive aspects highlighted by some residents and the drawbacks mentioned by others.\\\",\\n  \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n    \\\"Prospective residents should conduct thorough research on the block\'s current state and speak to existing residents to gain a comprehensive understanding of the living conditions.\\\",\\n    \\\"Consider visiting the neighborhood at different times of the day and week to assess t