n()\n#57 /home/glitched/lot-match-new/vendor/laravel/framework/src/Illuminate/Foundation/Console/Kernel.php(198): Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Application->run()\n#58 /home/glitched/lot-match-new/vendor/laravel/framework/src/Illuminate/Foundation/Application.php(1205): Illuminate\\Foundation\\Console\\Kernel->handle()\n#59 /home/glitched/lot-match-new/artisan(13): Illuminate\\Foundation\\Application->handleCommand()\n#60 {main}\n\nNext Illuminate\\Database\\QueryException: SQLSTATE[23000]: Integrity constraint violation: 1048 Column \'user_id\' cannot be null (Connection: mysql, SQL: insert into `activity_logs` (`user_id`, `role`, `action`, `table_name`, `record_id`, `old_data`, `new_data`, `ip_address`, `updated_at`, `created_at`) values (?, guest, update, blocks, 1, {\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Block 1\",\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block is a bit of a mixed bag, with residents sharing diverse perspectives on their experiences. Some have encountered issues like poor maintenance, leaking ceilings, and slow responses from management, painting a less-than-rosy picture of daily life. However, there\'s a silver lining as well \\u2013 one resident had a fantastic time and even expressed a willingness to return. This contrast in feedback suggests that while challenges exist, there\'s also potential for a positive living experience on this block.\\n\\nLooking at sentiment trends, it seems that opinions have fluctuated over time. Positive sentiments were recorded in December 2024 and May 2025, indicating moments of contentment or satisfaction within the community. On the other hand, negative sentiment was noted in March 2025 and June 2025, highlighting periods of discontent or frustration among residents. The neutral sentiments in November and December 2025 show a sense of stability or perhaps a lull in strong feelings during those months.\\n\\nIf you\'re considering a move\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood presents a mixed picture with residents expressing varied opinions on their living experiences. While some residents have faced challenges such as maintenance issues and slow responses from management, others have had positive experiences, indicating the potential for a pleasant living environment despite existing issues.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"Residents\' sentiments towards the neighborhood have shown fluctuations over time, with periods of both positive and negative feedback. This suggests a dynamic environment where residents\' experiences vary.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s livability rating is forecasted at 3.44, indicating a moderate level of satisfaction. The mixed sentiment from residents and the varying monthly feedback suggest that the neighborhood may offer both challenges and positive experiences to potential residents. It is essential for individuals considering a move to carefully weigh these aspects before making a decision.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should conduct thorough research and speak to current residents to gain a comprehensive understanding of the neighborhood\'s living conditions.\\\",\\n        \\\"Prioritize viewing multiple properties in the neighborhood to assess the overall maintenance standards and management responsiveness before committing to a lease or purchase.\\\",\\n        \\\"Engage with local community groups or online forums to get a sense of the neighborhood dynamics and potential challenges that may impact daily life.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":3.44,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 15:00:01\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T07:03:39.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, {\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a blend of contrasting experiences, making it a bit of a mixed bag. Some residents have encountered challenges like subpar maintenance, leaky ceilings, and slow responses from management, which can understandably dampen one\'s living experience. However, amidst these obstacles, there\'s a glimmer of hope as one resident had a fantastic time and would even consider a return.\\n\\nThe neighborhood seems to be a bit of a rollercoaster ride in terms of sentiment. While there have been fluctuations in resident feedback over time, with periods of both positive and negative sentiments, the overall forecasted rating stands at 3.14 out of 5. This suggests a somewhat average outlook on daily life in the area.\\n\\nDespite the ups and downs, one consistent point of agreement among residents is the promising investment potential present in the neighborhood. This could be an appealing factor for those looking to put down roots or make a smart financial move.\\n\\nIf you are considering a move to this block, it\'s essential\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"```json\\n{\\n    \\\"executi