        \\\"Stay informed about any ongoing efforts to address maintenance issues and enhance overall living conditions.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\\n```\",\"forecasted_rating\":3.14,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 15:04:05\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T07:04:16.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, {\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block is like experiencing a rollercoaster of opinions from residents. Some neighbors have voiced frustrations about the subpar maintenance, leaking ceilings, and unresponsive management, painting a less than ideal picture of daily life here. These challenges can understandably make one hesitant about settling in.\\n\\nOn the flip side, there are residents who have found silver linings in this community. They see the potential for investment in the area and have had positive experiences that make them consider staying. These individuals appreciate certain aspects of the block and see promise amidst the imperfections.\\n\\nLooking at the sentiment trends over time, it\'s clear that opinions have fluctuated. While there have been moments of positivity, such as in December 2024 and May 2025, negative sentiments have also crept in, particularly in March and June 2025. These ups and downs reflect the mixed bag of experiences residents have had, showing that the block\'s livability is a complex blend of highs and lows.\\n\\nFor someone considering a\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"execu