xed picture in terms of livability, with residents expressing both positive and negative sentiments about daily life here. While some individuals highlight the challenges related to maintenance issues and management responsiveness, others see potential for investment and appreciate certain aspects of the community. This dichotomy creates an environment where settling in may come with hesitations but also opportunities for those willing to look beyond the imperfections.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment analysis reveals a complex blend of opinions among residents, showcasing a rollercoaster of experiences that contribute to the neighborhood\'s overall livability.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s livability forecast is influenced by the mixed sentiments expressed by residents. While some see potential for growth and investment, others face challenges that detract from the overall appeal. This dynamic interplay between positive and negative experiences creates a fluctuating environment that can impact property trends. Potential buyers or investors should carefully consider the varying sentiments and seek to understand the underlying factors driving these opinions to make informed decisions about real estate in the area. Monitoring sentiment trends and community developments will be crucial for predicting future property dynamics.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engage with current residents to gain firsthand insights into the neighborhood\'s strengths and weaknesses.\\\",\\n        \\\"Conduct a thorough analysis of property maintenance and management practices to assess the potential impact on future property values.\\\",\\n        \\\"Stay informed about local community initiatives and development plans to gauge the area\'s growth potential.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.54,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 15:18:36\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T07:21:50.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, {\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block is like experiencing a rollercoaster of opinions from residents. Some people have faced challenges like terrible maintenance, leaking ceilings, and slow responses from management, painting a less-than-ideal picture of daily life. On the flip side, there are those who have had a fantastic experience, seeing great investment potential and even considering a return to the area.\\n\\nThe forecasted average rating of 2.54 suggests a mixed bag of experiences, reflecting the polarized views within the community. Looking at the sentiment trends, it\'s clear that opinions have fluctuated over time. Positive sentiments have been voiced sporadically, indicating moments of satisfaction and hope, while negative sentiments have also cropped up, likely due to ongoing issues and frustrations.\\n\\nFor someone considering moving to this block, it\'s important to weigh the pros and cons carefully. While there is potential for a great investment opportunity and positive experiences, it\'s crucial to be prepared for potential maintenance issues and management challenges. Engaging with current residents and\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood in focus presents a diverse range of experiences and opinions among its residents, creating a dynamic and at times unpredictable living environment. Residents\' feedback varies significantly, with some highlighting challenges such as poor maintenance and management responsiveness, while others express enthusiasm for investment opportunities and positive experiences. This contrasting feedback underscores the complex nature of daily life in the neighborhood, where both positive and negative aspects coexist, shaping the overall perception of livability.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment within the neighborhood is characterized by a mix of positive and negative experiences, reflecting the diverse perspectives held by residents. While some individuals express satisfaction and hope, others voice concerns and frustrations, creating a nuanced landscape of opinions. This diversity in sentiment indicates that the neighborhood\'s livability is subject to fluctuation and can be influenced by individual encounters and perceptions.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \