ve_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood in focus presents a diverse range of experiences and opinions among its residents, creating a dynamic and at times unpredictable living environment. Residents\' feedback varies significantly, with some highlighting challenges such as poor maintenance and management responsiveness, while others express enthusiasm for investment opportunities and positive experiences. This contrasting feedback underscores the complex nature of daily life in the neighborhood, where both positive and negative aspects coexist, shaping the overall perception of livability.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment within the neighborhood is characterized by a mix of positive and negative experiences, reflecting the diverse perspectives held by residents. While some individuals express satisfaction and hope, others voice concerns and frustrations, creating a nuanced landscape of opinions. This diversity in sentiment indicates that the neighborhood\'s livability is subject to fluctuation and can be influenced by individual encounters and perceptions.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0}\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The forecasted average rating of 2.54 for the neighborhood suggests a complex and varied living experience, emblematic of the divergent opinions expressed by residents. This rating reflects the mixed nature of feedback, with positive sentiments indicating moments of satisfaction and hope, and negative sentiments highlighting ongoing challenges and frustrations. The fluctuating sentiment trends over time further emphasize the dynamic nature of neighborhood livability, where experiences can differ significantly based on individual perspectives and interactions.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should engage with current residents to gain a comprehensive understanding of the neighborhood\'s dynamics and potential challenges before making a decision to move.\\\",\\n        \\\"It is advisable for individuals considering relocation to carefully evaluate the pros and cons of living in the neighborhood, weighing factors such as investment opportunities, maintenance issues, and management responsiveness.\\\",\\n        \\\"Maintaining open communication with neighbors and actively participating in community initiatives can help new residents navigate the diverse experiences and sentiments prevalent in the neighborhood, fostering a sense of belonging and understanding.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.54,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 15:22:19\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T07:22:19.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}, {\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 15:22:36\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, 127.0.0.1, 2025-12-03 15:22:36, 2025-12-03 15:22:36)) in /home/glitched/lot-match-new/vendor/laravel/framework/src/Illuminate/Database/Connection.php:825\nStack trace:\n#0 /home/g