pacted their quality of life. It might be wise to reach out to current residents for more insights and consider how comfortable you\'d be navigating any potential challenges that have been mentioned.\\n\\nUltimately, the decision to make this block your home hinges on your priorities and\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood on this block presents a mixed picture of living experiences, with residents expressing divergent opinions. Some residents have encountered challenges such as maintenance issues, leakage problems, and slow management responses, leading to an unfavorable living environment. Conversely, there are individuals who have enjoyed their time in the neighborhood and are contemplating a potential return, highlighting varying perspectives within the community.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment analysis reveals a range of opinions within the neighborhood. Positive feedback occasionally emerges, suggesting the possibility of a positive community vibe. Conversely, negative sentiments surface at times, indicating persistent difficulties or concerns that residents may confront.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 