 be attractive,\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood presents a diverse mix of experiences, offering a dynamic environment for residents. While there are promising investment opportunities that hint at future growth and value, some residents face challenges like maintenance issues and unresponsive management, leading to instances of dissatisfaction. Sentiment on the block fluctuates over time, with periods of contentment and frustration observed. Prospective residents should carefully evaluate the balance between potential growth opportunities and existing drawbacks before making a decision.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"Mixed sentiment exists within the neighborhood, reflecting a combination of positive and negative experiences among residents.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 1\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        },\\n        {\\n            \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\",\\n            \\\"positive\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"negative\\\": 0\\n        }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s dynamic environment and potential for growth make it an attractive option for residents seeking investment opportunities. However, issues with maintenance and management responsiveness can lead to resident dissatisfaction, impacting overall livability. The fluctuating sentiment trends indicate a mix of positive and negative experiences among residents, highlighting the need for careful consideration before moving to the block. Prospective residents should weigh the long-term benefits of future development against the current challenges faced by some residents.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should conduct thorough research on the neighborhood\'s maintenance and management practices.\\\",\\n        \\\"Engage with current residents to gain insights into their experiences and challenges.\\\",\\n        \\\"Consider the long-term investment potential of the area while also assessing the immediate living conditions.\\\",\\n        \\\"Stay informed about any community initiatives or planned developments that could affect the neighborhood\'s livability.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":2.54,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 18:40:28\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T11:40:21.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, {\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a mix of experiences, much like the diverse opinions of its residents. Some see great potential for investment in the area, hinting at a neighborhood on the cusp of transformation. However, it\'s not all smooth sailing as others have voiced concerns about maintenance issues, unresponsive staff, and slow management.\\n\\nThe sentiment trends over time paint a fluctuating picture. There have been moments of positivity, with residents expressing satisfaction, but these are interspersed with periods of discontent and frustration. This rollercoaster of opinions suggests a sense of unpredictability in the daily life on this block.\\n\\nIf you\'re considering moving here, it\'s essential to weigh the pros and cons carefully. While there may be opportunities for growth and a chance to be part of a changing community, potential challenges like maintenance issues and unresponsive management should not be overlooked. It might be worth reaching out to current residents to get a better sense of what to expect on a day-to-day basis.\\n\\nUltimately, the\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"The neighborhood on this block presents a mixed landscape of experiences and opinions among its residents. While some view it as a promising area for investment and potential transformation, others have raised concerns regarding maintenance issues, unresponsive staff, and slow management processes. This diversity in perspectives indicates a dynamic environment with both opportunities and challenges that contribute to the overall livability and desirability of the neighborhood.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"The sentiment analysis reveals a fluctuating pattern over time, showcasing varying levels of positivity and negativity among residents. While there are periods of satisfaction and contentment, there are also instances of discontent and frustration, highlighting the unpredictable nature of daily life in this neighborhood.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 },\\n        { \\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0 }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood\'s forecasted rating of 3.44 reflects the complex nature of the area, balancing positive aspects that attract investment and potential growth with challenges related to maintenance and management issues. This rating indicates a moderate level of desirability and livability, suggesting that while there are opportunities for development and community involvement, prospective residents should be mindful of the existing drawbacks and uncertainties in the neighborhood.\\\",\\n    \\\"recommendations\\\": [\\n        \\\"Prospective residents should conduct thorough research and due diligence before considering a move to this neighborhood, taking into account both the positive aspects and potential challenges highlighted by current residents.\\\",\\n        \\\"Engaging with the community and seeking firsthand insights from existing residents can provide valuable perspectives on the day-to-day living experience and help in making informed decisions about relocating to the area.\\\",\\n        \\\"It is advisable to carefully evaluate the maintenance standards and responsiveness of the management team in the neighborhood to ensure a comfortable and hassle-free living environment, considering the concerns raised by some residents in these areas.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":3.44,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T11:40:48.312732Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 19:40:48\",\"forecast_status\":\"done\"}, 127.0.0.1, 2025-12-03 19:40:48, 2025-12-03 19:40:48)) in /home/glitched/lot-match-new/vendor/laravel/framework/src/Illuminate/Database/Connection.php:825\nStack trace:\n#0 /home/glitched/lot-match-new/vendor/laravel/framework/src/Illuminate/Database/Connection.php(779): Illuminate\\Database\\Connection->runQueryCallback