f\",\"full_forecast_report\":\"```json\\n{\\n    \\\"executive_summary\\\": \\\"Living on this block offers a mixed bag of experiences, with residents sharing diverse viewpoints that paint a complex picture of daily life. Some express frustration with poor maintenance, leaking ceilings, and unresponsive staff, while others see potential for investment and future growth in the area. The block\'s living experience is hindered by challenges like slow management responses, but there is hope for improvement and development.\\\",\\n    \\\"sentiment_analysis\\\": \\\"Residents\' sentiments towards the block vary, showcasing a blend of frustrations and optimism. While some highlight existing issues that dampen the living experience, others emphasize the neighborhood\'s potential for growth and investment. The sentiment trends suggest a fluctuating outlook, influenced by both positive and negative experiences shared by residents.\\\",\\n    \\\"monthly_sentiment\\\": [\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2024-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-03\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-05\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 1, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-06\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 1},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-11\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0},\\n        {\\\"month\\\": \\\"2025-12\\\", \\\"positive\\\": 0, \\\"negative\\\": 0}\\n    ],\\n    \\\"forecast_details\\\": \\\"The neighborhood presents a blend of challenges and opportunities for residents. Issues like poor maintenance and unresponsive staff contribute to a less-than-ideal living environment, impacting residents\' overall satisfaction. However, the potential for future growth and investment hints at a brighter outlook, attracting individuals with a forward-looking perspective. Sentiment trends show fluctuations over time, reflecting the block\'s dynamic nature and th