n        \\\"It is advisable to engage with current residents to gain insights into their living experiences and assess the compatibility of the neighborhood with personal preferences.\\\",\\n        \\\"Maintaining a flexible and patient attitude towards potential challenges is essential for individuals considering a move to this block.\\\"\\n    ]\\n}\",\"forecasted_rating\":3.44,\"forecast_updated_at\":\"2025-12-03 20:31:39\",\"sentiment_data\":\"{\\\"2024-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-03\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-05\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":1,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-06\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":0,\\\"negative\\\":1},\\\"2025-11\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0},\\\"2025-12\\\":{\\\"positive\\\":0,\\\"neutral\\\":1,\\\"negative\\\":0}}\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:15:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-03T12:33:08.000000Z\",\"model_url\":\"basic\\/housemodel.glb\",\"forecast_status\":\"processing\"}, {\"ai_summary\":\"Living on this block offers a mixed bag of experiences, with residents sharing contrasting opinions that paint a vivid picture of what to expect. Some folks have encountered challenges such as subpar maintenance, leaky ceilings, unresponsive management, and encounters with unfriendly staff. These issues can understandably cause frustration and dissatisfaction for those residing here.\\n\\nOn the flip side, there are residents who rave about their time on the block, highlighting the exciting investment potential the area holds. These individuals see a promising future and are drawn to the neighborhood\'s growth prospects.\\n\\nAnalyzing the sentiment trends over time, we see a fluctuation in residents\' feelings. There have been periods with both positive and negative feedback, suggesting a rollercoaster of experiences. While some months show a balance between positive and negative sentiments, ot