(1,'Lot 1',35.00,42.00,2100000.00,1,63,'2025-10-20 22:16:16','2025-12-03 07:13:48','sold','West','Afternoon Sun','low','/models/basic/housemodel.glb','Welcome to Lot 1 in Block 1! This charming lot boasts a generous 35.00 sqm area, ideal for creating your dream home. Enjoy the warmth of the afternoon sun and low flood risk in this peaceful neighborhood. Don\'t miss this opportunity to build your perfect retreat in this inviting location.',NULL),
(2,'Lot 2',35.00,42.00,2100000.00,1,NULL,'2025-10-20 22:16:16','2025-11-10 18:14:12','sold','West','Morning Sun','low','/models/basic/housemodel.glb',NULL,NULL),
(3,'Lot 3',35.00,42.00,2100000.00,1,NULL,'2025-10-20 22:16:16','2025-11-10 18:14:12','sold','West','Full Day Sun','low','/models/basic/housemodel.glb','Welcome to Lot 3 in Block 1! This charming lot boasts a generous 35.00 sqm area, ideal for crafting your dream home. Enjoy full-day sun exposure and a serene atmosphere perfect for unwinding after a long day. With low flood risk and a price of PHP 2,100,000.00, this lot is a fantastic opportunity for those seeking a cozy and sunny retreat.',NULL),
(4,'Lot 4',35.00,42.00,2100000.00,1,NULL,'2025-10-20 22:16:16','2025-11-26 17:12:27','available','East','Full Day Sun','low','/models/basic/housemodel.glb','Welcome to Lot 4 in Block 1! This charming 35.00 sqm lot with a 42.00 sqm floor area is ready for you to turn your dream home into reality. Enjoy full-day sunshine and a low flood risk in this peaceful and inviting neighborhood. Don\'t miss this opportunity to create your perfect oasis!',NULL),
(5,'Lot 5',35.00,42.00,2100000.00,1,NULL,'2025-10-20 22:16:16','2025-11-07 16:38:13','available','North','Full Day Sun','low','/models/basic/housemodel.glb','Welcome to Lot 5 in Block 1! This charming 35.00 sqm lot boasts a lovely North orientation, ensuring full day sunlight for your future dream home. Priced at PHP 2100000.00 and with low flood risk, this lot provides an ideal canvas for creating your perfect sanctuary. Don\'t miss out on this opportunity to build your slice of paradise!',NULL),
(6,'Lot 6',35.00,42.00,2100000.00,1,NULL,'2025-10-20 22:16:16','2025-11-07 14:12:19','sold','South','Shade','low','/models/basic/housemodel.glb',NULL,NULL),
(7,'Lot 7',35.00,42.00,2100000.00,1,NULL,'2025-10-20 22:16:16','2025-11-07 16:10:31','sold','South','Full Day Sun','low','/models/basic/housemodel.glb','Nestled in a serene location, Lot 7 boasts ample space and a sunny orientation ideal for creating your dream home sanctuary. Its low flood risk and full-day sunlight make it a charming spot to build a cozy haven for your family. Don\'t miss the chance to turn this lot into your own slice of paradise!',NULL),
